WEBVTT

01:03.313 --> 01:05.982
GENIE, MAKE A WISH

01:07.776 --> 01:10.612
It wasn't rage.

01:12.572 --> 01:13.406
But this…

01:17.368 --> 01:18.369
This face

01:20.080 --> 01:21.456
is undeniably…

01:23.875 --> 01:24.709
true sorrow.

01:26.211 --> 01:29.881
I will now also give you sorrow

01:32.759 --> 01:35.637
I will give you sorrow
More precious than love.

01:36.221 --> 01:39.057
An old woman who had laid
A few tangerines on the street

01:39.140 --> 01:41.851
Shivering from a lifetime of cold
On a winter's night

01:44.104 --> 01:46.648
What is this anyway?
Why do I have to do this?

01:48.358 --> 01:50.026
Just keep reciting it.

01:50.527 --> 01:53.655
You'd better recite it
ten times every day, okay?

01:54.280 --> 01:57.117
Grandma hopes that my darling Ka-young,

01:57.826 --> 02:00.745
that you, my dear bundle of joy,
will one day

02:01.454 --> 02:04.290
cry your heart out with longing

02:04.374 --> 02:07.252
and also burst out laughing with joy.

02:07.752 --> 02:09.379
That's what I want for you.

02:09.462 --> 02:11.339
Let's try it, okay?

02:12.257 --> 02:15.885
To you, who rejoiced as you haggled
The price of tangerines…

02:15.969 --> 02:17.595
DESPAIR

02:17.679 --> 02:19.305
LONGING

02:19.389 --> 02:23.059
…I shall show you sorrow's equal face

02:27.355 --> 02:29.691
When I called out to you
From the darkness…

02:33.611 --> 02:36.364
Not once did you show me an equal smile

02:38.032 --> 02:40.869
When a frozen corpse
Froze yet again under a straw sack

02:42.036 --> 02:44.747
You did not so much
As cover it with another sack

02:47.834 --> 02:49.794
For your indifferent love

02:53.590 --> 02:56.467
For your tears
That seem incapable of flowing

03:10.148 --> 03:12.775
Iblis is not the kind of being
you think he is.

03:12.859 --> 03:16.404
My brother Iblis's sole purpose is
to hoodwink humans and drag them to hell.

03:16.487 --> 03:18.573
The only thing he can give you is hell.

03:19.616 --> 03:22.118
So please just make a righteous wish--

03:22.202 --> 03:23.286
Let me ask you.

03:25.371 --> 03:29.000
I will now also give you waiting

03:29.083 --> 03:30.376
What were you doing?

03:31.586 --> 03:32.837
You're an angel.

03:33.421 --> 03:36.382
While that young boy
and this young girl were dying…

03:38.218 --> 03:39.802
just what were you doing?

03:40.803 --> 03:42.096
I was praying, of course.

03:43.056 --> 03:45.266
I am his warrior first
and an angel second.

03:45.350 --> 03:46.434
Warrior?

03:47.644 --> 03:48.686
I am

03:49.812 --> 03:52.148
a mechanic who beats up assholes like you.

04:03.576 --> 04:04.494
Careful now.

04:05.536 --> 04:06.996
Hey, you got furniture?

04:08.665 --> 04:09.791
What is all this?

04:12.377 --> 04:13.878
It just sort of happened.

04:14.629 --> 04:17.715
Are you feeling any better?
I've never felt my heart hurt before.

04:18.299 --> 04:19.300
Did you see me

04:20.677 --> 04:23.680
crying tears of blood
before I was detained, by any chance?

04:23.763 --> 04:27.308
No, you were always the one
making humans cry tears of blood.

04:29.185 --> 04:32.438
Then did you perhaps see me
meet a woman before I was detained?

04:32.522 --> 04:33.940
I wouldn't know.

04:34.023 --> 04:36.818
You were moving around
from one jar to the next.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.778
Are you sure it wasn't Jinniya?

04:39.279 --> 04:40.655
It wasn't.

04:44.158 --> 04:46.286
What in the world was that?

04:47.078 --> 04:49.038
Why did I see the lump of clay's face?

04:50.832 --> 04:53.584
By the way, why did that start flowing?

04:53.668 --> 04:54.585
What's flowing?

04:57.797 --> 04:58.840
What the…

04:58.923 --> 05:01.968
Why is it suddenly flowing
after 983 years of being still?

05:02.051 --> 05:03.511
It wasn't flowing earlier.

05:03.594 --> 05:04.887
Why is it? What's going on?

05:05.388 --> 05:06.806
Do you think it could be that?

05:06.889 --> 05:09.309
It's my boss
who's contained here, isn't it?

05:09.392 --> 05:10.685
Then the answer's clear.

05:10.768 --> 05:13.563
It's the time you have left
to corrupt her.

05:13.646 --> 05:16.316
Your heart must have hurt
because this started flowing,

05:16.399 --> 05:18.234
and you don't have much time left.

05:18.901 --> 05:20.153
Could that really be it?

05:23.614 --> 05:25.867
Was I getting an early taste of death?

05:27.160 --> 05:28.536
How much time do I have left?

05:29.037 --> 05:31.039
Is this handful of sand

05:32.040 --> 05:33.291
all the time I have left?

05:36.878 --> 05:38.629
Iblis was in pain?

05:38.713 --> 05:40.923
Yes, according to
the magpies' testimonies.

05:41.007 --> 05:43.885
They say that everything
within his reach turned to ash.

05:43.968 --> 05:45.511
A pile of ash? It was that bad?

05:47.055 --> 05:48.097
Damn, why is that?

05:50.058 --> 05:52.393
Is it because I took Ki Ka-young
to see her past life?

05:52.477 --> 05:53.311
Pardon?

05:53.853 --> 05:56.230
Given the timing, that seems likely.

05:56.814 --> 05:58.775
Why did you show Ki Ka-young
her past life?

05:58.858 --> 06:03.571
I hoped Ki Ka-young, enraged by her death,
would seek revenge with a righteous wish.

06:04.155 --> 06:05.406
But it was pointless.

06:06.032 --> 06:07.033
That woman.

06:09.327 --> 06:10.912
She saw the truth.

06:12.121 --> 06:13.456
Not about her death,

06:13.539 --> 06:15.458
but how Iblis mourned it.

06:16.793 --> 06:18.419
That was an important contract…

06:20.463 --> 06:22.548
And she even clocked
the 20-year difference?

06:22.632 --> 06:24.550
Thankfully she doesn't know that much.

06:25.093 --> 06:27.678
But I think it's true
that pressuring her backfired.

06:28.554 --> 06:30.473
Ki Ka-young's lifespan changed.

06:36.187 --> 06:37.188
Her lifespan?

06:39.190 --> 06:42.860
I will put an end to the heavy snow
That once fell on this world

06:44.821 --> 06:47.532
I will take the spring snow
That fell on the barley fields

06:50.993 --> 06:53.996
And visit the sorrows of the people
Shivering with cold

06:54.914 --> 06:58.543
I will walk the snowy paths with you
Where it no longer snows

07:11.848 --> 07:13.099
It was getting late.

07:14.642 --> 07:16.227
I was visiting somewhere.

07:18.729 --> 07:21.023
We will talk of the power of sorrow

07:22.483 --> 07:25.820
And walk all the way
To the sorrow of waiting

07:38.541 --> 07:42.003
You're not answering my calls.
Are you busy? It's me, Gu Bo-gyeong.

07:42.670 --> 07:44.255
Let's see you squirm.

07:48.926 --> 07:52.638
This is probably around 1041 AD.

07:54.056 --> 07:56.309
There's still that 20-year difference.

08:11.157 --> 08:12.366
Damn it.

08:12.450 --> 08:14.035
You're still here doing this?

08:14.118 --> 08:16.454
I knew this would happen.

08:16.537 --> 08:20.374
My boss isn't just anyone. At this rate,
she'll make a righteous last wish.

08:20.458 --> 08:21.584
Smoothly and silently.

08:21.667 --> 08:23.669
Master's neck? Clean off.

08:23.753 --> 08:26.255
I knew this was how things would turn out.

08:28.174 --> 08:30.134
You should have told me if you knew.

08:31.093 --> 08:32.261
Don't use that word.

08:32.345 --> 08:35.264
No more words that start with "right."
I know what I'm doing!

08:35.348 --> 08:37.141
Really? What are you planning?

08:38.851 --> 08:41.395
Humans make such a fuss
and fight over love.

08:41.479 --> 08:44.899
They cry, laugh, and even thrive on love,
but in the end, it wrecks them.

08:45.399 --> 08:48.486
I'll brainwash them into her.
Joy, sorrow, waiting, and longing.

08:48.986 --> 08:50.071
And, if possible,

08:50.738 --> 08:51.739
even love.

08:54.075 --> 08:56.452
That's not exactly how that works.

08:57.328 --> 08:59.580
I shall infuse you with love,
O emotionless one.

08:59.664 --> 09:02.583
But I will not let you have me,
thus bringing you despair.

09:02.667 --> 09:03.793
Don't hold me back.

09:04.460 --> 09:05.753
If it's for revenge,

09:07.046 --> 09:08.589
I'll use love as a weapon.

09:10.299 --> 09:11.342
So what's your plan?

09:13.261 --> 09:15.555
First things first,
I'll become very irresistible.

09:15.638 --> 09:16.597
On that note…

09:16.681 --> 09:18.099
Don't be so ridiculous.

09:18.182 --> 09:19.725
Could you pay the Internet café?

09:20.226 --> 09:23.187
GORYEO ARABIAN MERCHANTS

09:23.271 --> 09:24.939
THE RAPID PROGRESS OF GORYEO SOCIETY

09:28.734 --> 09:31.320
RECORDS OF ARAB MERCHANT VISITS
CEASE AFTER 1040

09:31.404 --> 09:33.990
But the exchanges stopped
after the year 1040.

09:34.073 --> 09:35.032
I wonder why.

09:35.116 --> 09:36.701
Did someone block the path?

09:37.952 --> 09:39.829
Your second wish has also been fulfilled.

09:39.912 --> 09:41.956
The path to Goryeo has been blocked.

09:42.039 --> 09:44.333
Blocking that path
triggered quakes and tsunamis.

09:46.085 --> 09:48.337
So it was because of my wish?

10:00.725 --> 10:04.312
Why can't you just say it? This genie
is my genie. I am this genie's master!

10:07.565 --> 10:08.941
Turn off the music already.

10:09.025 --> 10:10.568
Or maybe you want to get smacked?

10:10.651 --> 10:13.279
Right? It's "maybe," right?

10:13.779 --> 10:16.198
I knew it. How he said, "Baby, let's go!"

10:16.782 --> 10:17.992
was just so strange.

10:18.659 --> 10:20.161
The writer must've been nuts.

10:22.121 --> 10:23.831
Hey! That writer is…

10:26.542 --> 10:27.418
Shut your mouth.

10:30.713 --> 10:34.300
There's more? Don't tell me.
A sequined tracksuit with foam on your…

10:36.344 --> 10:38.471
Wow, I hadn't even thought of that one.

10:41.015 --> 10:43.100
Go, Ki Ka-young!

10:43.184 --> 10:44.518
Bravo!

10:45.186 --> 10:46.771
You're amazing, Ka-young!

10:54.153 --> 10:56.822
I considered both options,
but I guess neither worked.

11:00.284 --> 11:01.410
Don't tell me you're…

11:01.494 --> 11:02.745
CHOI YOUNG-DO

11:04.580 --> 11:06.832
I hoped it wouldn't come to this too.

11:06.916 --> 11:09.752
But I have no other choice,
seeing as my life is on the line.

11:11.962 --> 11:15.383
Why are you always holding stuff
like that? Makes me want to protect you.

11:19.136 --> 11:20.846
That's oddly convincing.

11:21.514 --> 11:22.598
Fine, whatever.

11:22.682 --> 11:24.266
Take a seat over here, kid.

11:24.850 --> 11:26.060
What is this?

11:26.727 --> 11:28.396
Did my brainwashing actually work?

11:31.565 --> 11:33.275
About when I died.

11:34.110 --> 11:35.361
-In my past life.
-Yeah?

11:35.444 --> 11:37.697
Didn't you loathe me back then?

11:39.240 --> 11:42.910
Why would you think I didn't?
What, can't you see my loathing now?

11:49.458 --> 11:50.876
I can't.

11:53.462 --> 11:54.880
I've hidden it well, then.

11:56.090 --> 11:59.552
The expression I saw
was definitely true sorrow.

12:00.094 --> 12:04.014
The only people who look at me like that
are Grandma and Min-ji.

12:04.515 --> 12:07.643
I hear that's what they call
being cut deep.

12:09.645 --> 12:10.730
So what cut you?

12:10.813 --> 12:13.274
What are you talking about?
What did you see and where?

12:14.942 --> 12:16.610
Are there female genies too?

12:18.154 --> 12:19.405
What?

12:20.406 --> 12:22.700
What if there are? Why?

12:23.284 --> 12:24.869
-Are there?
-Jinniya?

12:25.870 --> 12:28.497
Of course there are.
That's what female genies are called.

12:29.081 --> 12:29.915
Jinniya.

12:31.000 --> 12:32.126
Have you ever seen one?

12:34.253 --> 12:36.213
A long time ago.

12:36.714 --> 12:37.840
Did you two date?

12:40.217 --> 12:43.053
A long… time ago.

12:43.637 --> 12:44.930
It was, you know…

12:45.806 --> 12:49.268
It was before Christ,
and I was really young back then, and--

12:49.351 --> 12:52.897
Whatever. Just show me the look.
The one you gave the female genie.

12:53.814 --> 12:56.442
Come on, how could I do that?

12:56.525 --> 12:59.820
I wasn't even using this face back then.

13:00.321 --> 13:02.406
My facial features were all different.

13:04.116 --> 13:06.786
Different, how?
Did you not have two eyes and a nose?

13:10.998 --> 13:14.502
Is the genie who controls the rain
a jinniya, by any chance?

13:15.002 --> 13:16.712
Then it must have rained every day.

13:18.422 --> 13:19.256
What?

13:21.509 --> 13:22.426
Did you two kiss?

13:24.386 --> 13:26.931
I had completely different
facial features, okay?

13:27.014 --> 13:29.433
This mouth didn't even exist back then!

13:31.602 --> 13:33.312
I'm actually late for something.

13:33.395 --> 13:34.563
See you at home.

13:36.482 --> 13:37.691
So you did.

13:37.775 --> 13:38.776
Get back here!

13:44.615 --> 13:46.784
That woman. She saw the truth.

13:46.867 --> 13:48.118
Not about her death,

13:48.619 --> 13:50.454
but how Iblis mourned it.

13:57.419 --> 13:59.296
It's been quite a while, Iblis.

13:59.380 --> 14:01.340
I ought to be saying that to you.

14:01.423 --> 14:03.217
It's been a while since I saw you.

14:03.801 --> 14:07.596
My dear Irem, you spent
every single day for 983 years

14:07.680 --> 14:11.475
faithfully aiding your master
in covering my lamp with more sand.

14:13.018 --> 14:14.562
I assume you have a request.

14:14.645 --> 14:15.729
I do have a favor.

14:16.272 --> 14:19.358
Any idea where and what
Jinniya is inhabiting these days?

14:19.441 --> 14:23.112
If you don't know, could you find out?
Without her knowing, of course.

14:23.195 --> 14:24.029
Until then.

14:32.872 --> 14:35.291
Mark down any items
close to expiring, okay?

14:35.374 --> 14:36.208
Yes, sir.

14:40.212 --> 14:41.922
Sir, when did you…

14:42.923 --> 14:45.134
I had a meeting
with a supplier this morning.

14:45.217 --> 14:47.469
It's ten minutes until lunch.

14:47.553 --> 14:50.472
Manager Kang, do you think
this is some kind of brunch café?

14:51.974 --> 14:53.809
Meeting? With which supplier?

14:53.893 --> 14:55.978
It's time for lunch,
so we should eat together.

14:56.937 --> 15:00.357
If I'm honest,
something urgent came up at home.

15:00.941 --> 15:02.067
I'm so sorry.

15:02.151 --> 15:03.569
I have no words.

15:03.652 --> 15:05.070
You're apologizing for this?

15:05.863 --> 15:09.366
Manager Kang, you shouldn't be
apologizing for this kind of thing.

15:09.450 --> 15:10.951
Just take responsibility!

15:11.577 --> 15:15.831
Your reputation and numbers are shit.
Even your work ethic is fucking shit.

15:17.124 --> 15:18.042
Director.

15:18.125 --> 15:19.793
You didn't even know I was coming,

15:19.877 --> 15:22.630
which means no one on your team
even bothered to warn you.

15:22.713 --> 15:25.758
How did you even become
a branch manager in the first place?

15:25.841 --> 15:27.426
Did you sell your soul to the devil?

15:28.344 --> 15:30.429
Twenty years is a lot
for a deadweight like you.

15:30.512 --> 15:34.224
Leave your resignation on your desk,
and just go. No need for a handover.

15:36.644 --> 15:38.812
I heard Cheongpung has great thistle rice.

15:38.896 --> 15:39.939
Yes, sir.

15:44.318 --> 15:46.445
Ms. Kang Im-seon,
are you out of your mind?

15:47.404 --> 15:48.238
Oh my gosh!

15:49.657 --> 15:52.660
I'm currently submitting my resignation.
Is there a problem?

15:53.744 --> 15:55.663
Since you won't be needing a handover,

15:56.163 --> 15:57.331
I'll be off now.

15:57.915 --> 16:00.125
I need to sell
the rest of my soul to the devil.

16:16.058 --> 16:17.101
Boss.

16:17.685 --> 16:19.770
I'll help you find your family.

16:20.270 --> 16:21.522
I won't ask questions.

16:23.524 --> 16:27.486
Maybe we should move past the car
and try to remember something else.

16:28.070 --> 16:28.904
Memories?

16:33.033 --> 16:34.284
"Let's go for a walk!"

16:38.664 --> 16:41.625
"That son of a bitch is so damn loud!
Just shut up already!"

16:42.251 --> 16:44.128
The lady in unit 904 was scary.

16:46.046 --> 16:48.340
The Animal H…

16:49.967 --> 16:52.511
Head? H… head.

16:55.097 --> 16:57.099
Dr. Kim. I'll bite him good.

16:59.518 --> 17:00.352
Head?

17:00.853 --> 17:01.687
Yeah.

17:05.232 --> 17:09.570
Healing, hall, habitual, hospital.

17:10.404 --> 17:12.406
There's a chance he's mistaken.

17:12.489 --> 17:15.784
If Dr. Kim is an actual doctor,
their surname must be Kim.

17:17.202 --> 17:18.037
I've found it.

17:18.704 --> 17:20.372
Boss, let's go.

17:20.956 --> 17:22.791
That hospital's two hours from here.

17:23.792 --> 17:24.752
Really?

17:30.841 --> 17:34.803
Are you really sure you lived here?

17:34.887 --> 17:35.971
This is the place.

17:36.930 --> 17:39.933
The way here from the hospital was right.

17:40.017 --> 17:41.643
Thank you, Chauffeur Kim.

17:45.439 --> 17:48.567
It looks as though they haven't been home
for at least three days.

17:49.485 --> 17:51.904
Then I need to "wait."

17:57.743 --> 17:59.161
I smell my younger brother.

18:05.751 --> 18:09.546
Could it be that he has memories
of being raised like a dog?

18:10.214 --> 18:11.632
That muttfucker!

18:21.183 --> 18:23.727
Maybe we picked a town
that's just too dull.

18:25.187 --> 18:28.232
No stories or action.
Just one big snoozefest.

18:32.945 --> 18:34.822
What is this? A phishing scam?

18:35.489 --> 18:36.448
Click.

18:37.825 --> 18:40.994
I AM GENIE, THE LAMP SPIRIT.
I SHALL GRANT YOU…

18:41.078 --> 18:42.663
What the… A genie?

18:44.498 --> 18:46.166
Man, the emojis hella suck.

18:46.250 --> 18:47.584
I SHALL GRANT THREE WISHES…

18:47.668 --> 18:51.004
WHATEVER. I'LL DM YOU THE DETAILS,
SO JUST MAKE A WISH

18:51.797 --> 18:53.924
Is Da-jin pulling a prank?

18:54.675 --> 18:55.509
All right,

18:56.009 --> 18:57.177
I'll bite.

18:57.761 --> 18:59.054
Let's see.

18:59.638 --> 19:02.099
Is there anything we could film
that would go viral?

19:02.182 --> 19:03.267
This village

19:04.268 --> 19:06.520
is just too quiet.

19:06.603 --> 19:08.897
SO WHAT? YOU WANT ME
TO MAKE A RACKET IN THE VILLAGE?

19:08.981 --> 19:12.151
These small towns are bound to have
one of those, you know…

19:12.234 --> 19:14.653
Right, like some

19:14.736 --> 19:17.030
secret crime hidden in the village.

19:22.411 --> 19:24.454
"It's been fulfilled"?
What a crock of shit.

19:24.538 --> 19:26.915
Hey, it would need to beat the algorithm.

19:26.999 --> 19:28.417
You think I'm some idiot…

19:32.129 --> 19:33.088
What the hell?

19:38.677 --> 19:39.511
Where am I?

19:39.595 --> 19:42.139
This is freaking me the hell out.

19:44.183 --> 19:45.809
When did I switch this on?

19:47.936 --> 19:51.773
Right, hello, everyone.
Yes, I've had a few drinks.

19:53.275 --> 19:54.109
What?

19:55.277 --> 19:56.528
I didn't fall over.

19:57.029 --> 19:58.405
I was just lying down…

20:02.534 --> 20:04.912
Why's there a stupid hole here?

20:08.582 --> 20:09.416
Sorry?

20:11.126 --> 20:12.461
Was there something there?

20:14.004 --> 20:15.797
Well, I always do as you ask.

20:15.881 --> 20:17.966
All right. Okay.

20:18.050 --> 20:20.594
Thanks to you guys,
I'm digging in the dead of night.

20:20.677 --> 20:22.346
What would even be here?

20:26.266 --> 20:27.267
What's this?

20:28.810 --> 20:30.938
Holy shit!

20:32.272 --> 20:33.607
END OF LIVESTREAM

20:35.943 --> 20:36.944
SWEETHEART

20:38.278 --> 20:39.363
Da-jin.

20:39.446 --> 20:40.697
Da-jin!

20:40.781 --> 20:41.990
There's a corpse!

20:42.074 --> 20:43.242
Start streaming again.

20:43.825 --> 20:45.744
Go live again, you idiot!

20:45.827 --> 20:48.163
We had over 100 live viewers!

20:48.247 --> 20:49.081
What?

21:03.262 --> 21:05.847
We've passed 600,000 views!

21:05.931 --> 21:07.641
And who discovered this? Me.

21:07.724 --> 21:10.310
Yours truly. Me, Ko Yeong-hyeon.

21:10.394 --> 21:13.063
-I discovered it, I tell you.
-Why did you even go there?

21:13.146 --> 21:15.107
-That late. In the middle of drinking.
-What?

21:18.819 --> 21:20.112
I AM GENIE, THE LAMP SPIRIT

21:20.195 --> 21:21.530
IT'S BEEN FULFILLED

21:22.990 --> 21:23.949
No way.

21:25.117 --> 21:25.951
The genie?

21:26.451 --> 21:28.370
I heard from Constable Oh,

21:28.453 --> 21:31.540
and the corpse was fully decomposed.

21:32.416 --> 21:35.335
If you can help it,
please avoid going out at night.

21:35.419 --> 21:38.005
And if you must,
make sure to travel in pairs.

21:38.088 --> 21:40.465
Goodness, this is scary as hell.

21:41.091 --> 21:43.510
What is all this chaos
in our usually quiet village?

21:44.011 --> 21:45.012
Indeed.

21:48.849 --> 21:50.559
Yeah, that auto shop.

21:51.059 --> 21:53.520
Just one body doesn't mean
she stopped at killing one.

21:53.603 --> 21:56.481
If she's always been a psychopath,
they should investigate her--

21:56.565 --> 21:57.649
Just a moment.

21:58.400 --> 22:00.152
It wasn't Ka-young.

22:00.235 --> 22:03.613
On what basis are you spouting
that absolute horse shit?

22:03.697 --> 22:05.198
I won't treat you. Please leave.

22:05.282 --> 22:08.243
Why are you snapping at us?
This isn't the only clinic around.

22:08.327 --> 22:12.497
Which is why I'm asking you to leave
before I press charges for defamation!

22:13.081 --> 22:16.501
We didn't even say anything out of line.
Why's she shouting at her clients?

22:16.585 --> 22:17.794
I'm so put off.

22:32.726 --> 22:34.186
We need detergent.

22:34.269 --> 22:35.228
Right, that one.

22:37.731 --> 22:39.483
I wonder if Pan-geum even knows

22:39.566 --> 22:42.152
what's going on here
over in Hawaii or whatever.

22:42.235 --> 22:44.821
Do you know why Pan-geum
still hasn't come back?

22:44.905 --> 22:48.575
She's abandoned her too.
She's run away for good.

22:48.658 --> 22:50.535
Ka-young always used her grandma as cover

22:50.619 --> 22:53.080
to sell us the lie
that she was just like anybody else.

22:53.163 --> 22:55.624
So yeah, we all played along.

22:55.707 --> 22:59.461
But to be completely honest,
Ka-young is the most suspicious.

22:59.961 --> 23:02.089
You can't change someone's nature.

23:02.589 --> 23:05.008
That's utter nonsense.

23:05.092 --> 23:08.136
I am a former Marine.
I'm as sharp as a tack.

23:08.220 --> 23:11.473
It takes 20 years, minimum,
for a corpse to fully decompose.

23:11.556 --> 23:13.683
Twenty years ago,
Ms. Ki would have been eight.

23:14.643 --> 23:16.686
How would an eight-year-old kill a person?

23:16.770 --> 23:18.438
Why the hell not?

23:18.522 --> 23:21.358
There must be sketchy stuff
all over that auto shop of hers.

23:21.441 --> 23:24.111
Things that could melt
human flesh right down.

23:24.194 --> 23:26.988
You've always had
a vivid imagination, Ms. Park.

23:33.120 --> 23:34.996
Grandma, what is it? Why are you crying?

23:35.789 --> 23:36.915
Who died this time?

23:43.213 --> 23:44.631
Ka-young.

23:44.714 --> 23:46.967
No matter what people say about you,

23:48.385 --> 23:50.470
even if they suspect you and such,

23:51.763 --> 23:53.890
you must not harm them, okay?

23:53.974 --> 23:56.810
Why would I harm them? I didn't do it.

23:58.437 --> 23:59.771
Of course, my darling.

24:00.730 --> 24:02.482
I know that very well.

24:02.566 --> 24:06.611
I just worry others might not know
and point their fingers at you.

24:07.195 --> 24:09.322
I hate you crying more than any of that.

24:09.823 --> 24:10.657
Don't cry.

24:12.492 --> 24:15.036
All right. I won't cry.

24:15.120 --> 24:18.331
My tears have all dried up.

24:19.499 --> 24:21.460
Gosh, I'm so out of it.

24:21.543 --> 24:24.671
I got frozen pollack for spicy fish stew,
but forgot the crown daisy.

24:25.172 --> 24:27.257
I'll get some.
Don't go out unless you have to.

24:28.383 --> 24:30.635
Grandma, you stay here and make the broth.

24:53.366 --> 24:55.911
Thirty missed calls,
and you didn't think to call back?

24:58.371 --> 24:59.623
Why exactly did you call?

24:59.706 --> 25:01.333
Come explain yourself at the bank.

25:01.416 --> 25:04.419
You know, right? That your money's
being transferred to my account.

25:04.503 --> 25:06.713
My accounts were frozen because of you.

25:07.214 --> 25:08.632
This indicates tax evasion.

25:08.715 --> 25:10.842
Am I currently committing tax evasion?

25:12.093 --> 25:16.097
Don't play dumb. You gave it to me
willingly, whatever the reason!

25:16.181 --> 25:17.140
That makes it a gift!

25:17.724 --> 25:20.977
So just come and tell the bank
that you gifted it to me.

25:22.103 --> 25:23.271
Or I'll report you.

25:25.982 --> 25:26.816
Report me?

25:28.026 --> 25:31.404
You committed the crime,
and you're reporting me?

25:34.115 --> 25:34.950
You're a murderer.

25:35.659 --> 25:38.286
Everyone says you're the one
behind that skeleton murder.

25:38.870 --> 25:41.915
You act like you're hot shit,
but I could just kill you.

25:42.415 --> 25:44.251
How do you think your money came to me?

25:44.334 --> 25:46.836
I made a wish to a genie, the lamp spirit.

25:48.213 --> 25:50.340
It doesn't matter whether you believe me.

25:50.423 --> 25:51.508
Just deal with it.

25:52.425 --> 25:54.427
Otherwise, I'll wish to have you killed.

25:55.095 --> 25:57.264
Make the wish, then. Just kill me now.

26:00.058 --> 26:03.937
But if you kill me now,
my grandma will inherit all my money.

26:04.020 --> 26:05.772
You won't see a cent of it.

26:06.523 --> 26:08.024
You fucking bitch!

26:08.858 --> 26:10.235
You psychopathic bitch!

26:10.318 --> 26:12.112
You're right. I am a psychopath.

26:12.737 --> 26:15.699
So it would have been easier for me
to make mistakes.

26:15.782 --> 26:18.994
But I always made the difficult choice
to grow up decent.

26:19.703 --> 26:22.497
So life has been a total fucking bore.

26:23.790 --> 26:24.833
But what about you?

26:25.333 --> 26:28.420
You're not even a psychopath,
so why do you make such choices?

26:30.213 --> 26:33.508
If the bank contacts me, I'll tell them
the truth. That you embezzled.

26:34.342 --> 26:35.802
You could try begging the genie.

26:36.678 --> 26:37.846
But you know, Bo-gyeong,

26:37.929 --> 26:41.224
whatever you wish for,
you won't get anything. Why, do you ask?

26:41.308 --> 26:45.103
Because no matter what you wish for,
I'll wish for it all to be reversed.

26:46.438 --> 26:47.731
I do believe in genies.

26:52.319 --> 26:54.362
I have a wish left, too, you see.

26:57.157 --> 26:57.991
What?

27:03.663 --> 27:05.248
To think that Satan was right.

27:05.332 --> 27:07.626
This is a clear example
of human corruption.

27:08.543 --> 27:10.378
Gu Bo-gyeong and even me.

27:14.591 --> 27:15.425
Are you all right?

27:18.928 --> 27:20.722
You know, with everyone suspecting you.

27:22.307 --> 27:23.642
I grew up used to that.

27:23.725 --> 27:26.978
After all, murders and psychopaths
are closely related.

27:33.568 --> 27:37.030
Where's the highest point
in this neighborhood?

27:50.627 --> 27:52.420
You can push me if you'd like.

27:52.921 --> 27:55.215
It's been a while
since we did something like that.

27:58.510 --> 28:00.762
You won't break
in a satisfying way from up here.

28:01.763 --> 28:02.806
But you knew that, right?

28:06.768 --> 28:08.520
That's Cassiopeia over there.

28:09.979 --> 28:11.231
And that's Orion.

28:11.940 --> 28:14.025
Right, everyone seems to know those two.

28:14.526 --> 28:15.360
Tell me more.

28:16.778 --> 28:17.904
I see.

28:17.987 --> 28:21.324
That explains why that's all you see
when you look it up.

28:23.284 --> 28:24.911
Even spirits only get that far?

28:26.830 --> 28:31.209
Look. Wow.
It's almost like it's raining stars.

28:31.751 --> 28:32.752
Rain?

28:32.836 --> 28:34.921
No, we don't even have any alcohol.

28:35.463 --> 28:38.675
And, most importantly,
you're not pretty today.

28:39.384 --> 28:41.344
I asked Min-ji again.

28:41.428 --> 28:42.721
She said stars come second.

28:42.804 --> 28:45.640
What matters more is
how pretty the other person looks.

28:46.349 --> 28:47.183
Me?

28:47.767 --> 28:50.729
Me, who's only worn the prettiest
of faces since the dawn of time?

28:50.812 --> 28:52.897
-What part of me isn't pretty?
-Your hair part.

28:53.398 --> 28:56.943
Must you wear it on that side?
Your face is a little asymmetrical.

28:57.569 --> 29:01.406
Then can't you just come to my right
and look at me from a slight angle?

29:02.657 --> 29:03.575
I don't think I can.

29:04.242 --> 29:05.994
I'm not perfectly symmetrical either.

29:06.619 --> 29:09.205
How is it we still can't have
a proper conversation?

29:10.665 --> 29:13.251
Then, do you want a shoulder to lean on?

29:13.835 --> 29:16.379
Or do you maybe want me
to tousle your hair?

29:16.463 --> 29:19.632
Or, perhaps, I'll wear a coat
and walk over impressively.

29:25.430 --> 29:26.723
What's with those eyes?

29:29.559 --> 29:33.313
I can't change my hair part.
I've perfected it since the start of time.

29:34.314 --> 29:36.858
-Let's go with the first one.
-The first one?

29:38.485 --> 29:40.195
Oh, my shoulder?

29:42.071 --> 29:42.989
Here.

29:47.327 --> 29:49.579
Damn you, Ki Ka-young!

29:49.662 --> 29:51.039
I wasn't fooled by you!

29:51.122 --> 29:55.335
I gave you my shoulder for you to push!

29:55.960 --> 29:57.796
Tends to stand by his pride.

30:03.593 --> 30:05.762
Where's she gone without her phone?

30:05.845 --> 30:06.846
Ka-young!

30:11.643 --> 30:13.812
Ka-young wasn't answering her phone, so…

30:14.896 --> 30:16.689
This is the house you're staying at

30:17.190 --> 30:18.441
for half a year?

30:18.983 --> 30:20.860
Well, you see…

30:23.112 --> 30:27.867
I am a very close friend of Ka-young's.

30:27.951 --> 30:28.785
Very.

30:28.868 --> 30:30.119
You know Ka-young?

30:32.705 --> 30:33.873
That's so strange.

30:36.209 --> 30:37.502
Where is Ka-young right now?

30:38.503 --> 30:40.338
Your hair part is also not exactly…

30:46.386 --> 30:47.929
What is this, Ki Ka-young?

30:48.513 --> 30:51.891
Why is that man
casually walking into this house?

30:52.392 --> 30:54.936
And how is it this lady
is casually walking out of it?

30:57.647 --> 31:00.692
-She's a close--
-Don't you dare say she's a close friend.

31:00.775 --> 31:02.318
I've known you for 14 years.

31:02.402 --> 31:03.820
Even when you were in college,

31:03.903 --> 31:07.407
you came from Daejeon to Seoul
to have gamja-tang with me.

31:07.490 --> 31:09.450
Now you suddenly have a close friend?

31:09.534 --> 31:11.327
Can't you handle this like last time?

31:11.911 --> 31:13.705
You didn't even plan for this?

31:14.622 --> 31:16.249
Were you fibbing about being smart?

31:16.749 --> 31:18.418
Classy choice of words.

31:18.501 --> 31:22.088
You stay right there,
or I'll call the cops.

31:22.171 --> 31:26.217
Hey, the whole town is wild
with all this talk of corpses and stuff.

31:26.718 --> 31:28.928
Come on, what is this, Ki Ka-young?

31:29.012 --> 31:30.471
Well, it's…

31:30.555 --> 31:32.015
Brother!

31:37.729 --> 31:40.899
I heard my older brother was here
from the Middle East,

31:41.482 --> 31:43.151
so I came to see him.

31:43.234 --> 31:46.696
Right. Lee Mi-ju. Lee Beul-li.

31:46.779 --> 31:48.156
We're siblings, see?

31:48.239 --> 31:49.282
Bro!

31:51.117 --> 31:52.410
Siblings?

31:54.787 --> 31:56.331
I know exactly what this is.

31:56.414 --> 31:57.874
Bong Joon Ho's Parasite.

31:58.708 --> 32:02.962
One by one, you're moving your family in
until the whole place is yours.

32:03.046 --> 32:04.964
But there's no basement here,

32:05.840 --> 32:07.717
so is there one more living in that shed?

32:07.800 --> 32:08.635
Come on.

32:19.395 --> 32:20.438
No way.

32:22.732 --> 32:23.816
Come here.

32:23.900 --> 32:25.318
You people.

32:25.401 --> 32:27.070
Show me your IDs right now.

32:28.154 --> 32:29.113
True friendship.

32:29.739 --> 32:31.866
That's right, you brat.
This is friendship.

32:32.533 --> 32:36.829
What are you all doing?
I want to see your IDs. Right now!

32:38.790 --> 32:40.458
I won't tell you right now.

32:40.541 --> 32:42.085
No matter what you say, I won't.

32:42.168 --> 32:43.878
But I'll tell you everything later.

32:43.962 --> 32:46.214
Don't ask me anything about those two.

32:47.048 --> 32:48.841
Or you'd be getting in my way.

32:49.717 --> 32:50.843
When exactly is later?

32:50.927 --> 32:53.179
I don't know. Just later.

32:55.014 --> 32:55.890
Just trust me.

32:59.811 --> 33:02.647
Fine. I'm sure you have a reason.

33:02.730 --> 33:03.648
I trust you.

33:05.149 --> 33:07.318
But wasn't it three, not two?

33:07.402 --> 33:09.737
Aren't we counting the one
who was in the shed?

33:11.239 --> 33:13.866
Right. He and Lee Beul-li
are sort of a package deal.

33:13.950 --> 33:14.784
Yes.

33:24.335 --> 33:27.547
The two female guests just checked out,
saying the town is too scary.

33:28.172 --> 33:30.008
I know. I got the call.

33:31.342 --> 33:33.803
Did something happen? You don't look well.

33:34.303 --> 33:37.223
You're getting on my nerves,
so you should turn in now.

33:37.724 --> 33:38.558
All right.

33:40.059 --> 33:42.895
Why does he keep chopping firewood
when it's hot out?

33:54.407 --> 33:57.076
What the hell
have they left behind this time?

33:58.036 --> 33:59.370
Well, fuck me!

34:00.204 --> 34:01.622
It's finally here.

34:01.706 --> 34:03.291
It's finally appeared again!

34:13.134 --> 34:15.720
Why did it take you so damn long
to show up again?

34:15.803 --> 34:19.849
I even went to where I hit that deer
in case I needed to be there to see you.

34:20.349 --> 34:22.393
Okay. Here's my second wish.

34:22.477 --> 34:26.773
Let me take a trip back, 20 years ago,
to December 23, 2004, at 11:40.

34:33.905 --> 34:35.323
I need to check something.

34:42.830 --> 34:44.874
CHEONGPUNG VILLAGE HALL

34:44.957 --> 34:48.377
What the hell? Why are we
in broad daylight? I said 11:40!

34:48.461 --> 34:50.129
11:40 is during the day.

34:50.213 --> 34:51.589
Fuck.

34:51.672 --> 34:54.509
You should have said 23:40
if you meant night.

34:54.592 --> 34:58.513
How am I supposed to wait until night?
I'm itching to know!

35:00.306 --> 35:03.059
Darling Jeong-hwa,
are you happy to see Ka-young?

35:04.143 --> 35:07.522
Here, take a look.
She smiles whenever she sees you.

35:07.605 --> 35:10.525
Ka-young, all of those people
who say nasty things to you,

35:10.608 --> 35:13.069
they only do that
because they carry doubt inside.

35:13.653 --> 35:14.987
You get me, don't you?

35:19.784 --> 35:21.744
I don't know. It's too hard.

35:24.247 --> 35:27.250
So that bitch grows up
to own the auto shop.

35:27.792 --> 35:29.752
That brat is a psychopath, you know.

35:29.836 --> 35:33.381
We have time to kill, so how about
we play hide-and-seek with that bitch?

35:43.224 --> 35:44.892
What the fuck was that for?

35:48.521 --> 35:51.023
Why do people keep
leaving things behind in the past?

35:53.901 --> 35:57.071
Where is it that you're trying to go?
Can you tell me exactly?

35:58.114 --> 35:59.907
20 YEARS AGO, 23:39

35:59.991 --> 36:00.950
20 YEARS AGO, 23:40

36:01.033 --> 36:02.410
BLACK HAIR DYE

36:02.493 --> 36:05.580
Why would you even
dye your hair like this?

36:06.289 --> 36:08.249
It's not very ladylike, is it?

36:10.585 --> 36:12.003
I got some on your face.

36:41.115 --> 36:42.116
Fuck.

36:42.700 --> 36:43.910
For fuck's sake.

36:51.042 --> 36:52.251
Damn it.

36:53.586 --> 36:54.712
Fuck!

37:02.011 --> 37:04.764
So it was Mom. It was Mom!

37:05.598 --> 37:09.810
I knew for sure someone was there,
yet they never reported me.

37:10.311 --> 37:12.813
I wondered why every day for 20 years.

37:16.359 --> 37:19.278
Is it really so exciting
that the witness to your crime

37:20.446 --> 37:21.614
was your mother?

37:21.697 --> 37:24.575
Mom would never be able to report me.

37:24.659 --> 37:27.036
She's got my back, just like you do.

37:27.119 --> 37:30.957
Now I can relax and get on
with killing more skanky bitches

37:31.040 --> 37:32.959
to make this world a cleaner place.

37:33.042 --> 37:34.085
Right away!

37:37.713 --> 37:39.924
So this is how the lump of clay felt.

37:40.675 --> 37:42.760
My thought process was similar too.

37:43.970 --> 37:45.429
But this is just revolting.

37:47.932 --> 37:51.352
EOM SANG-TAE, JULY 20, 2024
MADE HIS SECOND WISH

37:51.435 --> 37:55.982
WENT BACK 20 YEARS TO CONFIRM THE WITNESS

37:56.065 --> 38:00.278
THE WITNESS WAS HIS MOTHER

38:08.995 --> 38:11.205
Why didn't you tell me, Mom?

38:12.748 --> 38:14.375
I know everything now.

38:14.959 --> 38:16.794
You saw me, didn't you?

38:18.713 --> 38:22.758
If only I'd known earlier,
I wouldn't have held back for so long.

38:33.561 --> 38:34.478
Hair dye?

38:34.562 --> 38:37.857
Yes. He was dyeing
the dead corpse's hair black.

38:37.940 --> 38:39.608
Her hair was red.

38:40.484 --> 38:41.986
The bastard's a serial killer.

38:42.069 --> 38:45.948
Some detectives stopped by recently,
saying a woman had gone missing in town.

38:48.617 --> 38:52.413
Given the circumstances, it's likely
she was Eom Sang-tae's victim too.

38:55.207 --> 38:56.500
Either way, thanks to you,

38:56.584 --> 38:59.378
we uncovered the real killer
behind a 20-year-old cold case.

39:00.755 --> 39:03.466
It's not thanks to me,
but thanks to the wish you made.

39:03.549 --> 39:05.134
Tell me if you're angry. I'll kill him.

39:05.217 --> 39:06.719
I'll fold him like a twig

39:06.802 --> 39:09.430
and drag him all the way to hell for you.

39:09.513 --> 39:11.974
No, we can't deal with him like that.

39:12.058 --> 39:15.478
This bastard needs to be locked up.
He can go to hell after that.

39:15.561 --> 39:18.814
We'll strike when Eom Sang-tae
makes his final wish.

39:18.898 --> 39:20.358
Leave this one to me.

39:20.941 --> 39:22.026
Wow.

39:22.109 --> 39:23.778
I'm starting to wonder now.

39:24.695 --> 39:26.697
Will I really be able to beat you?

39:28.991 --> 39:31.994
"If there comes a moment
that Iblis bows his head before a human,

39:32.078 --> 39:32.912
you shall

39:32.995 --> 39:34.997
slit your brother's throat."

39:36.749 --> 39:38.000
Tell me if you want to beat me.

39:39.335 --> 39:41.003
Grandma has become young again,

39:41.087 --> 39:42.671
and life is just no fun.

39:45.508 --> 39:46.717
So I'll let you win.

41:16.557 --> 41:17.850
Hello. Welcome.

41:19.560 --> 41:20.853
Here we go.

41:23.856 --> 41:25.733
-What would you like?
-A small gamja-tang.

41:25.816 --> 41:28.277
A small? Which one?
With greens or aged kimchi?

41:31.989 --> 41:33.866
Is the gamja-tang place up for sale?

41:33.949 --> 41:35.576
Yes. How did you know?

41:35.659 --> 41:39.580
They're asking for well below
market price. Ms. Ki, are you interested?

41:53.469 --> 41:54.303
I'm back.

41:54.803 --> 41:58.098
Eat up.

42:43.894 --> 42:46.730
Long time no see, Mr. Shadi.

42:47.231 --> 42:48.691
Why'd you put the world to sleep?

42:48.774 --> 42:50.693
I knew that you would be awake.

42:51.443 --> 42:52.736
And if you're here,

42:52.820 --> 42:54.822
it means Ejllael must be close by.

42:55.823 --> 42:59.868
I don't know
if Iblis puts up with Ejllael,

43:00.578 --> 43:02.871
but I still have bad blood with Ejllael.

43:03.914 --> 43:05.082
He killed our brothers.

43:05.165 --> 43:09.211
I'm asking if there's any reason
for me to stop you.

43:09.295 --> 43:12.298
Do not worry.
This has nothing to do with you angels.

43:14.216 --> 43:15.426
The night is short,

43:17.177 --> 43:18.679
and my steps are heavy.

43:19.555 --> 43:21.682
They will only lead me
to the one I wish to see.

43:49.501 --> 43:51.670
We're in big trouble, boss!

43:52.880 --> 43:54.673
We're in big trouble, Ejllael!

43:57.801 --> 43:59.970
We're in big trouble, Irem!

44:06.226 --> 44:07.061
Take a look.

44:07.144 --> 44:10.356
He's been tied up with this thread,
and he can't move.

44:10.856 --> 44:11.690
What?

44:13.567 --> 44:14.735
This black thread?

44:15.569 --> 44:17.529
You couldn't cut this,
so you called us all?

44:17.613 --> 44:18.656
I tried that at first.

44:18.739 --> 44:20.949
I don't know what this thread is,

44:21.033 --> 44:23.702
but it weighs a ton
and is impossible to cut.

44:23.786 --> 44:24.620
Is that so?

44:25.371 --> 44:27.331
I should buy some of this.

44:27.414 --> 44:28.749
I'd make good use of this.

44:28.832 --> 44:30.084
What…

44:33.003 --> 44:36.507
Servant of the angel. You cannot lie.

44:36.590 --> 44:39.802
Only you were free to roam last night.
Tell me everything you know.

44:40.761 --> 44:43.013
I encountered Shadi last night.

44:43.931 --> 44:45.683
He put the entire world to sleep

44:45.766 --> 44:48.811
and was walking,
taking incredibly laden steps.

44:49.812 --> 44:50.979
Aren't you busy today?

44:51.563 --> 44:52.690
Who is Shadi?

44:52.773 --> 44:55.526
He's a brother
who controls sleep with song.

44:55.609 --> 44:58.153
I know Shadi paid me a visit
because I fell asleep.

44:58.237 --> 45:00.447
But it's even stranger
if this was his doing.

45:00.531 --> 45:01.532
This…

45:03.200 --> 45:05.285
This isn't Shadi's power.

45:05.369 --> 45:08.539
None of our brothers has the ability
to make such a thread.

45:10.040 --> 45:13.419
If you're all brothers, does that mean
all genies share the same birthday?

45:13.502 --> 45:15.295
Yes, they were all born on a Thursday.

45:15.796 --> 45:18.215
I was born on a Wednesday
and you, a Friday.

45:18.298 --> 45:20.884
Why invent
a birth secret for someone else?

45:20.968 --> 45:22.886
I was born on a Monday.

45:23.554 --> 45:25.097
That's not what that means--

45:25.180 --> 45:27.558
That's not what's important here!

45:28.392 --> 45:30.561
You show up late
and still make small talk?

45:30.644 --> 45:33.021
You know I travel
at 50 kilometers per hour.

45:33.522 --> 45:34.982
I ran here in a frenzy.

45:35.065 --> 45:38.694
Really? You looked so poised
in your pictures online.

45:38.777 --> 45:39.653
That's right.

45:39.737 --> 45:41.697
That's why I try to avoid running if I--

45:41.780 --> 45:45.534
Shadi tied me up, so could you at least
find and bring him here, brother?

45:45.617 --> 45:47.369
You know he hates my guts.

45:48.203 --> 45:50.664
You don't look too uncomfortable.
Just stay put.

45:50.748 --> 45:53.333
If I get loose,
the first thing I'll do is kill you!

46:05.345 --> 46:08.265
Wait, did you just cut off my wrists?

46:08.348 --> 46:11.226
He said the thread was impossible to cut,
so I cut your wrists.

46:11.310 --> 46:12.978
Did you want me to cut the thread?

46:14.229 --> 46:16.523
I'm sure you heard it all,
but it won't be easy to…

46:17.608 --> 46:19.485
-Wow.
-Wow.

46:23.864 --> 46:24.698
Wow.

46:25.783 --> 46:28.243
Wait, that actually worked?

46:28.744 --> 46:29.703
How did that work?

46:29.787 --> 46:31.747
Who knows? Maybe I'm just strong.

46:32.664 --> 46:34.249
Or perhaps because I'm your master.

46:38.045 --> 46:39.546
I need to get to the food bank.

46:42.007 --> 46:44.551
VAT settlements are due this month,
so please excuse me.

46:45.052 --> 46:47.179
Hey, get over here. What are you hiding?

46:49.389 --> 46:51.225
Thanks for that. I need to speak to her.

46:51.308 --> 46:52.267
By the way,

46:52.351 --> 46:54.353
I saw you left me out to dry
in the desert.

46:55.103 --> 46:55.938
I saw it all.

46:56.605 --> 46:59.525
That angel who just left
showed me how I died in my past life.

47:00.484 --> 47:02.027
That jerk can't be serious!

47:04.154 --> 47:05.280
About that…

47:07.866 --> 47:11.954
The situation back then was a little,
you know, that way.

47:12.746 --> 47:15.916
Wow. I don't make this kind
of demand very often.

47:16.625 --> 47:17.584
Sade.

47:17.668 --> 47:19.670
-Bite her.
-What? Me?

47:20.254 --> 47:21.171
Oh, my fingers.

47:25.759 --> 47:27.427
I don't bite people, boss.

47:28.470 --> 47:31.098
Of course, I know.
Dear Sade doesn't bite people.

47:31.181 --> 47:32.891
You do, right? I was scared there.

47:33.809 --> 47:37.145
But you did clear the way for a pack
of wild hounds to tear me apart.

47:38.188 --> 47:39.106
Before I died.

47:39.690 --> 47:41.191
So you saw that?

47:41.275 --> 47:44.903
Wow! Master! Please obliterate me!

47:44.987 --> 47:46.572
Come here. Get over here.

47:46.655 --> 47:49.783
If you all leave,
then who will take me out of here?

47:52.077 --> 47:53.495
Damn you, you just had to--

47:53.579 --> 47:55.163
Shall we talk about Shadi?

47:55.247 --> 47:58.584
Isn't that more urgent right now?
Otherwise, I'll keep my mouth shut.

47:58.667 --> 47:59.710
Damn you.

48:00.460 --> 48:02.880
Shadi came to see me and tied me up.

48:02.963 --> 48:05.090
I haven't even seen him
since the 300-year war.

48:05.173 --> 48:08.760
His heavy footsteps mean
he's also tied up by that thread.

48:08.844 --> 48:10.596
He must have come to tell me that.

48:10.679 --> 48:13.599
Shadi is someone's hostage again,
just like he was back then.

48:13.682 --> 48:16.727
And you know something, and you cannot lie
under any circumstances.

48:19.980 --> 48:21.106
Was it your doing again?

48:21.189 --> 48:23.734
No. This was your doing.

48:24.610 --> 48:25.861
Shadi has a master.

48:25.944 --> 48:28.739
Shadi bestowed the ring he inhabited
and chose his own master.

48:28.822 --> 48:29.823
He is no hostage.

48:30.532 --> 48:32.034
This is the extent of my answer.

48:32.534 --> 48:35.746
-What do you mean this is my doing?
-I can't hear you.

48:35.829 --> 48:38.874
You're right. Whatever you say is right.
Yes, all right.

48:38.957 --> 48:41.793
Prattle away
because I just can't hear you.

48:46.089 --> 48:47.591
So who's Shadi's master?

48:49.134 --> 48:50.677
Cunning bastard.

48:52.179 --> 48:53.639
Want to know who his master is?

48:53.722 --> 48:55.057
The immortal being

48:55.557 --> 48:57.559
that your arrogance created back then.

49:00.354 --> 49:02.189
Please save Hunbish.

49:02.773 --> 49:05.192
Please let him live a long, long life.

49:06.610 --> 49:07.444
Him?

49:34.388 --> 49:37.933
I don't even remember his face.
You're saying he's in town right now?

49:38.016 --> 49:40.185
No. I won't. I don't know. No such thing.

49:40.268 --> 49:42.187
Whatever you ask,
I'll answer with one of--

49:42.270 --> 49:43.897
His Servant, Ejllael.

49:43.981 --> 49:47.025
Where is he? What's the color
of his front door? Shape of his roof?

49:47.109 --> 49:48.402
Bloody Satan!

49:49.194 --> 49:50.028
Damn it.

49:53.365 --> 49:56.201
Damn it! My shirt!

49:57.077 --> 49:58.161
Sade!

50:01.999 --> 50:04.334
This air. The smell of blood.

50:04.418 --> 50:08.505
Isn't this when my boss died
in her past life? 983 years ago?

50:08.588 --> 50:09.423
That's right.

50:09.923 --> 50:11.842
I made an immortal at this time.

50:13.385 --> 50:16.972
I somewhat extrapolated
from the lump of clay's wish.

50:19.516 --> 50:21.268
But I can't remember his face.

50:22.269 --> 50:23.895
He'll be passing by here soon.

50:24.396 --> 50:26.231
You remember his scent

50:26.314 --> 50:28.066
and find him when we get back.

50:29.693 --> 50:32.070
He's definitely somewhere
in Cheongpung village.

50:32.696 --> 50:34.031
Yes, Master.

51:29.836 --> 51:31.588
Are you the one who saved me?

51:33.715 --> 51:35.342
My name is Hunbish.

51:36.676 --> 51:37.719
Thank you.

51:40.514 --> 51:41.389
Yeah?

51:43.016 --> 51:44.935
You didn't seem
too grateful in the future.

51:45.727 --> 51:46.561
What do you mean?

51:46.645 --> 51:48.855
There's no point in remembering my face.

51:48.939 --> 51:50.899
I'll appear to you with a different face.

51:55.946 --> 51:58.406
And don't you dare
do anything stupid to my brother.

51:59.741 --> 52:01.409
I will seek you out soon, kid.

55:36.541 --> 55:41.546
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
